# Warlock — a Typical enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 3/12 Typical enemies — 14 life, bribe 60 gold
# enemy: Warlock (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0055.dck "Warlock (B, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3 file
#   dated 2016-02-15; its first 10 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 12 lines (60 cards)
#   after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its .vNone/.v<Colour>
#   sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/warlock.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 3) [Tier
#   3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/warlock.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Typical) — "Warlock" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Warlock
